    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d35575e064bb0f4728ee3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不好意思，欢呼声太大了，我没听清……。\n训练员先生，请再说一遍♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f493a94e6169d4c4fdd4f48399a215308379c4c8699712fb34d2ae925b1570c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
