      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43767a898cdf66403f3c742",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但既然要和她一同以“最强”为目标，自我包装就是必不可少的。\n换言之，这也算是面向闪耀系列赛的预演吧……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dee9480d92047aeee1b62defc8f61f5f2b6a180b9f9a98dc9b2193fad85c966",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
