    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810c9af8af3aaae00712521f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多人赛事的最外档压倒性不利。\n东海帝王同学究竟会采用什么作战——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a45487b4ba8d231d09493ad9dbc1b064e55a5abe91ce85cce182e2e873401c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
